# A SQUAT IN THE MACHINE CITY (src/content/interiors/squat.gd): one of the few
# houses somebody lives in, in the machines' own gaps -- dark, no fire, a tarp
# over the window, a stolen strip lamp, a bedroll -- and the way out nobody
# sees from outside, a hole through the back wall behind a sheet.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/squat.tour --seed=4 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the door. 02 is the squat from above. 03 is over the shoulder at the
# crawl hole. 04 is outside behind the house, having crawled out (`out_back`).
coast calm
near door:squat
await door 5
wait 0.6
shot 01-a-door-in-the-machine-city with door,land:machine_city

press use 0.1
await inside:squat 5
wait 1.0
shot 02-the-squat with inside:squat

hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
near thing:crawl_hole
wait 1.0
shot 03-the-way-out-the-back with inside:squat,shoulder
release shoulder_peek
near crawl
await crawl_near 3
wait 0.3
press use 0.1
await out_back 5
wait 1.2
shot 04-out-behind-the-house with land:machine_city
